  (text
    "FPGA interface: 2x 80-pin 2.54 mm SMD headers on the bottom side, parallel to the long edge. Header column k (pins 2k-1/2k) sits under the ADV7513 of OUT ceil(k/10): J7 = D13-D23 (+D1/D2/D4/D5/D10), J8 = D0-D9/D11/D12/CLK/DE/HS/VS/HPD/INT (+I2C, 5V). 3.3 V LVCMOS, 148.5 MHz SDR: keep ribbon cables short (< 15 cm)."
    (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c557db2d-e4a6-4028-ba3b-7ddd35a068d6"))
